<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken to use cash surplus for purchase.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken to use cash surplus for purchase.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Handelsbanken said on Thursday it would finance its 23 billion crown bid for mortgage bank Stadshypotek with cash from the difference between its lending and deposits.</p>
<p>&quot;We have a difference between lending and deposits of 25 billion crowns. It's money we have not been able to lend out. We will use this cash surplus to fund the bid. You could say we're borrowing from ourselves,&quot; Handelsbanken chairman Arne Martensson said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
